      "module": "VERIFICATION-BASE",
      "normalized_sha256": "e54bea80484cbb8804d4209bec87416297d9f66faaaf8bc7987299c35ffceaf3",
      "rationale": "Defines the Int-Float case of orderGe in terms of the supplied ltIF primitive.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-e54bea80484cbb8804d4209bec87416297d9f66faaaf8bc7987299c35ffceaf3",
      "start_line": 51,
      "text": "  rule orderGe(I:Int, F:Float)\n    => notBool ltIF(I, F)\n    [simplification]"
    },
    {
      "attributes": [
