+    5 |-> list ( vCons ( str ( iCons ( 98 , .IntSeq ) ) , vCons ( str ( iCons ( 97 , .IntSeq ) ) , vCons ( str ( iCons ( 99 , .IntSeq ) ) , .ValSeq ) ) ) )
+    6 |-> list ( vCons ( true , vCons ( 2 , vCons ( 0.15000000000000000e1 , .ValSeq ) ) ) )
+    7 |-> list ( vCons ( noneV , .ValSeq ) )
+  </heap>
+  <heapLoc>
+    8
+  </heapLoc>
+  <stack>
+    .List
+  </stack>
+  <ret>
+    noRet
+  </ret>
+  <exc>
+    NoExc
+  </exc>
+  <exit-code>
+    0
+  </exit-code>
+</generatedTop>
+
+The executed smoke module contains the assertion
+can_arrange(["b", "a", "c"]) == 1. The final .K and exit-code 0 are an
+operational witness that source strings are real, reachable, and relevant.
+

