+The source-rule/obligation mapping is structurally exact, unique, ordered, and nonempty. The mathematical value-universe weakening is recorded separately.
diff --git a/evidence/05-string-universe-weakening.log b/evidence/05-string-universe-weakening.log
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..20e586e03744fb33da4963453db3044e7d421fd2
--- /dev/null
+++ b/evidence/05-string-universe-weakening.log
@@ -0,0 +1,39 @@
+FROZEN K SOURCE
+/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:15
+  syntax Str ::= str(IntSeq)
+
+/reference/k-proof/reference-semantics/semantics/str.k:59
+  rule applyCmp(">=", str(A:IntSeq), str(B:IntSeq)) => notBool strLt(A, B)
+
+/reference/k-proof/verification.k:11-13,63-65,106-108
+  orderablePair includes (isStr(V) andBool isStr(W)); orderGe has a Str/Str
+  equation; the DOMAIN_LEMMA is guarded by orderablePair.
+
+GENERATED LEAN
+/reference/klean-generation/generated/Klean135CanArrange/Sorts.lean:7
+  inductive SortStr : Type
+
+There is no constructor. SortVal only has inj_SortStr : SortStr → SortVal,
+so no string value can inhabit the generated target's quantified SortVal.
+The generated tree contains no translation of the frozen constructor
+str(IntSeq) : Str, although verification-kompiled/definition.kore contains
+Lblstr...MPY-CORE_Str_IntSeq.
+
+CANDIDATE CONSEQUENCE
+/candidate/Proof.lean:174-175 and 301-302 eliminates every string arm with
+`nomatch string`. AuditOperational.lean independently compiled:
+
+  theorem generatedStringSortIsEmpty : SortStr → False := by
+    intro value
+    nomatch value
+
+Thus the Str/Str tenth case of the source domain lemma is vacuous in the fixed
+Lean theorem. This is a weakened obligation and an operational-bridge failure.
+
+COUNTERFACTUAL
+AuditOperational.lean also defines falseOrderGe := false and falseApplyCmp so
+that the >= branch returns falseOrderGe. The theorem
+counterfactualStillProvesFixedTarget compiles. Therefore the fixed equation
+alone is insensitive to a materially false interpretation; exact parameter
+implementations are essential, and the missing Str constructor prevents one.
+
